"<h2>Tech Stack</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Runtime:</strong> Bun</li>\n<li><strong>Framework:</strong> TanStack Start (React 19, Nitro) + TanStack Router &#x26; TanStack Query</li>\n<li><strong>Database:</strong> PostgreSQL 16 + Drizzle ORM</li>\n<li><strong>UI:</strong> Mantine 9, Lucide icons, React Compiler, Monaco Editor, xterm.js, Recharts</li>\n<li><strong>i18n:</strong> Lingui (English source catalog, Vietnamese translation)</li>\n<li><strong>Infrastructure:</strong> <code>ssh2</code>, Docker, Traefik v3, Cloudflare Tunnel, <code>@modelcontextprotocol/sdk</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Project Layout</h2>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-text\"><span class=\"line\"><span>src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  features/&#x3C;feature>/   # &#x3C;x>.functions.ts (server functions), &#x3C;x>.server.ts (logic), schema.ts, &#x3C;x>.query.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  components/           # Mantine UI components by feature, plus ui/ primitives</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  routes/               # Thin TanStack file-based routes (+ api/ routes: v1, mcp, webhooks, streams)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  config/               # Registries &#x26; settings: permissions, statuses, identifiers, database engines, server.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  db/schema/            # Drizzle ORM table definitions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  plugins/              # Template provider plugins (e.g. Supabase)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  server/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    api/                # REST v1 route registry, OpenAPI 3.1 generator, MCP server</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    services/           # Executor (SSH/local), server bootstrap, template engine, monitoring, backups, cloud sync</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    routes/             # Nitro routes (WebSocket terminal)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    plugins/            # Startup plugin (schedulers, recovery, catch-up)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  locales/              # Lingui catalogs (en.json, vi.json)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>templates/              # App templates (template.toml + docker-compose.yml / overlay.yml)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>drizzle/                # SQL migrations (0000_baseline.sql + incremental migrations)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>scripts/                # install.sh, migrate.ts, rotate-encryption-key.ts, i18n &#x26; smoke scripts</span></span></code></pre>\n<h2>Database Migrations</h2>\n<p>The schema lives in <code>src/db/schema/*.ts</code>, and <code>drizzle/</code> begins from a baseline (<code>0000_baseline.sql</code>). After changing schema files, run <code>bun run db:generate</code> (commit both the generated SQL and snapshot) and <code>bun run db:migrate</code>. For custom SQL (triggers, data migrations), use <code>bunx drizzle-kit generate --custom --name &#x3C;name></code>.</p>\n<h2>Code Quality &#x26; Standards</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Linting &#x26; Formatting:</strong> Biome (<code>bun run check</code>) and Stylelint for CSS.</li>\n<li><strong>Internationalization:</strong> Every user-visible string must pass through Lingui (<code>i18n._(...)</code> or module-level <code>msg()</code>). Run <code>bun run i18n:extract &#x26;&#x26; bun run i18n:compile</code> and <code>bun run i18n:check</code> after changing UI or template strings.</li>\n<li><strong>Commits:</strong> Follow <a href=\"https://www.conventionalcommits.org/\">Conventional Commits</a> (enforced by Lefthook + Commitlint).</li>\n<li><strong>Pre-PR Checks:</strong> Ensure <code>bun run typecheck</code>, <code>bun run check</code>, and <code>bun run test</code> all pass before opening a pull request.</li>\n</ul>"